{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Poison Strike",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to make a weapon deadlier. As a Bonus Action, you touch one weapon or piece of ammunition and conjure a special poison on it. The poison lasts for 1 minute. The next time you hit a target with an attack using that weapon or ammunition, the target takes poison damage immediately after the attack. The poison damage equals 2d10 + your paladin level, or 20 + your paladin level if you had Advantage on the Attack Roll.</p>",
